
Test Dataset:
  A collection of conversation samples containing:
  User prompts
  Reference responses (actual VTuber responses)
  Context (if any)
  Emotional state (if relevant)


Weighted Trait System:
  Core traits (detective, time traveler) have higher weights (1.5)
  Secondary traits (gremlin) have medium weights (1.2)
  Regular traits have normal weights (1.0)
  Optional traits have lower weights (0.8)


Two-Level Matching:
  Direct matches: Exact character trait terms (full score)
  Contextual matches: Related phrases and expressions (partial score)

Speech Pattern Bonus:
  Added bonus points (0.2 each) for using Amelia's speech patterns
  Includes hiccups, gremlin noises, and characteristic phrases


More Comprehensive Indicators:
  Added more contextual phrases for each trait
  Included gaming-related terms
  Added characteristic expressions
  Included emotional indicators